<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lab Environment Being Prepared</title>
    <!--[if mso]>
    <noscript>
        <xml>
            <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
                <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
            </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
        </xml>
    </noscript>
    <![endif]-->
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #f8f9fa;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding: 20px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: white; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                    <!-- Header -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 40px 40px 30px 40px; text-align: center;">
                            <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                🚀 {{companyName}}
                            </div>
                            <h1 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #1f2937; margin: 0;">
                                Lab Environment Being Prepared
                            </h1>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Lab Info Section -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 0 40px;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #667eea; border-radius: 10px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 25px; text-align: center;">
                                        <div style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: white; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                            {{labName}}
                                        </div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: white; opacity: 0.9;">
                                            {{labDescription}}
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Progress Section -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 40px;">
                            <div style="font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                                Hello {{userName}},
                            </div>

                            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 25px 0;">
                                We're currently setting up your lab environment. This process typically takes a few minutes
                                while we configure all the necessary tools and resources for your learning experience.
                            </p>

                            <!-- Progress Steps -->
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; margin: 25px 0;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width: 30px; vertical-align: top; padding: 5px 15px 5px 0;">
                                        <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background-color: #10b981; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5px 0;">
                                        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 5px;">Environment Allocation</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">Securing compute resources</div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width: 30px; vertical-align: top; padding: 15px 15px 5px 0;">
                                        <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background-color: #f59e0b; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 15px 0 5px 0;">
                                        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 5px;">Software Installation</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">Installing required tools and dependencies</div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width: 30px; vertical-align: top; padding: 15px 15px 5px 0;">
                                        <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background-color: #e5e7eb; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></div>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 15px 0 5px 0;">
                                        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 5px;">Final Configuration</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">Applying lab-specific settings</div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <!-- Estimated Time -->
                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #f0f9ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin: 25px 0;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                            ⏱️ Estimated Setup Time
                                        </div>
                                        <div style="color: #374151;">
                                            {{estimatedTime}} - We'll notify you as soon as your lab is ready!
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 25px 0 0 0;">
                                You'll receive another email with access instructions once your environment is fully prepared.
                                In the meantime, you might want to review any pre-lab materials or documentation.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 30px 40px; background-color: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: center;">
                            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">
                                Questions about your lab setup? Contact us at
                                <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin: 0;">
                                © {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
        }
        .status-indicator {
            background-color: #fbbf24;
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            background-color: #e5e7eb;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10b981, #34d399);
            height: 100%;
            width: 45%;
            border-radius: 4px;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.7; }
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f0f9ff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🚀 {{companyName}}</div>
            <h1 class="title">Lab Environment Being Prepared</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

            <p>Great news! We're setting up your dedicated lab environment for an amazing hands-on learning experience.</p>

            <div class="lab-info">
                <div class="lab-name">{{labName}}</div>
                {{#if labDescription}}
                <p style="margin: 10px 0; opacity: 0.9;">{{labDescription}}</p>
                {{/if}}
                <div class="status-indicator">🔧 Setting Up Environment</div>
            </div>

            <div class="progress-bar">
                <div class="progress-fill"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>⏱️ Estimated Setup Time:</strong> {{estimatedTime}}</p>
                <p>We're creating your personalized AWS environment with all the tools and configurations you'll need for this lab.</p>
            </div>

            <p><strong>What's happening behind the scenes:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>🏗️ Provisioning AWS EC2 instance</li>
                <li>🔧 Installing required tools and dependencies</li>
                <li>⚙️ Configuring lab-specific environment</li>
                <li>🔒 Setting up secure access credentials</li>
                <li>✅ Running final verification checks</li>
            </ul>

            {{#if statusUrl}}
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{statusUrl}}" class="button">Check Setup Status</a>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <p>You'll receive another email as soon as your lab environment is ready. Then you can dive right into your hands-on learning experience!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Questions about your lab setup? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
